ble clamp: `stamped-budget` = `min(budget, max-filed)` on the wire (mirror chase k=1 sends no `more` at all), and `install-more!` installs `min(k−1, free capacity)` so a surplus-sending peer still can't evict anything.\n- Eviction changed from lowest-id to arrival order (`:filed-seq`/`next-age!`); `file!` files newest-then-evicts-oldest, so filing never evicts itself. The lowest-id starvation route round 1 flagged is genuinely closed, and the deviation from the architect's ordering is **explicit** in the reconcile report and doc"}]}}
